    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this two-bedroom, one-bathroom terraced home located at 9 Hyacinth Street. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising a welcoming living area, a kitchen and dining space, two comfortable bedrooms, and a family bathroom, providing a practical layout in a convenient residential setting.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis attractive home combines a peaceful residential setting with exceptional convenience, making it ideal for first-time buyers, , investors, or those seeking a well-connected Dublin address.\r\n\r\nThe property is positioned within easy reach of the Docklands, IFSC, East Point Business Park and Dublin City Centre, while the nearby neighbourhoods of Clontarf, Fairview and Drumcondra provide an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, parks and local amenities. The area has seen significant regeneration in recent years and continues to grow in popularity with buyers seeking proximity to the city without compromising on community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent. Connolly Station, Clontarf Road DART Station and numerous Dublin Bus routes are all close by, offering swift access throughout the city and suburbs. The Port Tunnel, M1 and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible, making commuting exceptionally convenient.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the wide selection of nearby primary and secondary schools, including St Joseph’s CBS, Marino College, Scoil Mhuire and Mount Temple Comprehensive School. Dublin City University and Trinity College Dublin are both within convenient reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Foyer: 2.95m x 1.07m with laminated wood flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: 3.70m x 3.66m with laminated wood flooring, pendant lighting, feature fireplace with white tile surround. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner: 3.61m x 2.67m Fitted kitchen with floor units, fitted cabinets, laminated wood flooring, pendant lighting, back-splash, oven/grill, extractor fan, etc. \r\n\r\nBedroom: 4.36m x 2.07m with laminated wood flooring, pendant lighting, \r\n\r\nHall: 3.19m x 1.54m\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.04m x 1.84m with floor to ceiling tiled flooring, corner glass shower unit, W.H.B., W.C..\r\n\r\nBedroom: 2.59m x 2.79m with laminated wood flooring, pendant lighting. \r\n\r\nTotal: 51m² / 549 sq ft\r\n\r\nExternally: The property features convenient off-street parking at the front. The rear garden includes a low-maintenance patio area, providing a functional outdoor space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
